sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant User
    participant UI as Streamlit UI
    participant Gateway as API Gateway
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant Agent
    participant Vector as ChromaDB
    participant Graph as Neo4j
    participant Web as Tavily Search
    participant Redis

    User->>UI: Ask Question
    UI->>Gateway: POST /query
    Gateway->>MQ: Push request
    Gateway->>Redis: Store "processing"

    MQ->>Agent: Consume request

    Agent->>Vector: Vector Search
    Agent->>Graph: Graph Query

    alt High Confidence
        Agent->>Gateway: Send result
    else Low Confidence
        Agent->>Web: Web Search
        Web->>Agent: Results
        Agent->>Gateway: Send result
    end

    Gateway->>Redis: Store result

    UI->>Gateway: Poll /result
    Gateway->>Redis: Fetch result
    Redis->>Gateway: Return result

    Gateway->>UI: Response
    UI->>User: Show Answer